# Journey: the title's Journey opens the stage grid; stage 1 starts; the hint
# (H) and Enter place pieces until the goal is met; the results show the score
# breakdown, Next starts stage 2 (now unlocked), which is paused and left.
until 300 Play
frames 30
click =Journey
until 60 40 authored stages
frames 10
expect Stage 2, Easy, locked
click =Start
until 120 Goal: 150 points
frames 30
expect =Row 1 column 1, empty
repeat 4000 until Goal Complete!
  key KeyH 1
  frames 3
  key Enter 1
  frames 12
end
frames 30
expect Objective reached. Journey stage 1.
expect Total score
expect Achievements: First Light
save journey-results
click =Next
until 120 Goal: 200 points
frames 20
click =Open info panel
until 30 Journey 2
click =Open info panel
frames 5
click =Pause
until 60 =Resume
frames 10
save journey-paused
click =Leave Round
until 120 Journey stage 2/40
frames 10
expect Rank: Novice Wrapper
